startup_steps:
  - Read workspace.uai, .uai/totem.uai, .uai/taboo.uai, canonical memory, decision index, .uai/short-term-memory.uai, .uai/operations.uai, and .uai/test-plan.uai.
  - Verify authoritative root and branch, inspect status without reverting unknown work, fetch remote, and confirm protected tree boundaries.
  - Treat reports as advisory and follow reviewed wiki/ledger routes rather than raw prose. Use workspace.uai current_companion_truth for current source state; preserve earlier checkpoint claims as historical.
  - Preserve immutable failed operations and all campaign counters.

current_truth:
  progress_route: Read docs/ecosystem-cleanup-2026-09-12.md for current evidence and dated C1-C120 history. Historical failed gates do not describe current access.
  canonical_source: E:\Source\Rust\TinyRustLM.com only; model bytes under D:\LLMs\TinyRustLM, outside Git. Leave X:\LLMS alone. No extra checkout, source copy or backup tree.
  source_control: Commit and push coherent reviewed work regularly, then verify direct remote equality. Git publication is separate from website publication.
  delivery: Owner authorizes existing FTP/FTPS website delivery and ordinary Git only; all seven repositories have Actions disabled. Do not enable paid GitHub features. Read operations.uai owner_delivery_policy.
  cleanup: Owner cleanup receipts for241 files,431 installer files plus2 links, and26 experiment directories are independently verified. Previous37 unreadable-path and two-installer-link blockers are resolved. Physical storage recovery is unmeasured.
  source_admission: C120 full tests recreated the retired empty E:/Temp/TinyRustLM-Test-Custody parent; source recheck now fails there. Fixture scratch is corrected to canonical artifacts. Removal was policy-rejected; owner-only Remove-ReviewedEmptyTestFolders.ps1 previews both reviewed empty folders, Apply unexecuted. Preserve the exact setuptools dependency fixture.
  publication: C114 TinyRustLM0.5.0 published through FTPS from78665b15ceda70bf933c11e92241ec1555ebe6c5;32 files verified,7 retired routes absent, final marker/public HTTPS identities exact, lease cleanup verified. Live Edge smoke passes12 observations with empty catalog fixture. Read cleanup C114 and artifacts/web-deployments.
  validation: All18 affected publisher tests pass. Local and live Edge smoke each pass12 observations; an earlier zero-argument local wrapper failure was not reproduced and remains unexplained. No before/after visual-parity or model-execution claim.
  cleanup_limit: Failed-attempt disposable files removed and useful evidence preserved.32 empty folders from failed/successful attempts remain after automatic policy review rejected removal; never retry via another API or parent deletion. Owner-only script is recorded in cleanup C114.
  product_limit: No qualified small working default, real MiniModel seed, native/WASM model qualification, outside-network P2P or live memory proof follows from code publication.
  source_eligibility: Read cleanup C115-C118. The42-entry exclusion policy covers all three expanded-inventory selections. Code-Expert scored3/6; both JSON derivatives scored5/6 with color-only format failure. These are related public development results, not independent holdout evidence. No aliases, resampling or replay of closed quality failures.
  source_runtime: C117 used the existing5.13.1 source environment after a committed compatibility review. No dependencies, checkpoint metadata or numerical-reference locks changed; do not classify loader failures as model-quality failures.
  rejected_source_cleanup: C116-C118 source deletions were rejected before execution; six files each remain. Never retry via another API or parent. Owner-only Remove-ReviewedRejectedSource.ps1 selects CodeExpert, Biggiraffe or Ljh728; previews pass, Apply unexecuted.
  numerical: C119 reference-runtime verification passes. C120 native build and5 probe tests pass; clean release gate23/23 and verifier pass. Full standard run failed;93 corrected fixture tests and5 browser fault checks pass. Owner cleanup, full standard rerun, fresh v3 registration and real traces remain required. Preserve the reference interpreter and closed failures.
  packages: NuGet0.1.8 remains unpublished; actual ARM64 consumer execution is missing. Do not substitute cross-compilation for execution or read a publishing key before gates pass.
  current_state_details: workspace.uai
  companion_source: dotnet/src/TinyRustLM.Companion/CompanionProductionOperationRuntime.cs
  browser_source: tinyrustlm/app/index.html
  evidence_boundary: docs/companion/README.md

memory_truth:
  direct_agent: MemoryEndpoints long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination across ecosystem agents.
  user_plugin: TinyRustLM.com Connect explicit sign-in to MemoryEndpoints as selected long-term memory.
  backup: Synchronized current UAI/wiki/approved stores may duplicate memory during prelaunch.
  evidence: No live operation claim without an exact receipt.

hard_boundary: One prelaunch clean-slate product; no legacy, compatibility, migration, fallback, repair, hidden retry, best-of-N, debt, secret leakage, or counter inflation.

current_intake:
  date: 2026-09-27
  reports: September27 Rust quality report and prior sixteen September19 reports reviewed; exact evidence, decisions and proof of use are retained.
  maturity: Early alpha, never a working release; no debt, obsolete code or legacy support until a fully working release is officially accepted by the owner.
  routing: .uai/index.uai separates current guidance from dated historical receipts; earlier August resume prose is not current source state.
  blockers: Fresh v3 numerical registration, qualified working default, live seed, package evidence and remaining explicitly recorded cleanup boundaries stay open; prior installer/source-access blockers are resolved.
  seed_progress: C32 native identity/CORS mismatch fixed; actual Edge transfers six synthetic members. Public metadata readbacks remain empty and authority-incomplete; static model serving and release gates remain open. See native-seed-browser-contract-review.json.
  static_preparation: C34 MiniModel 01063a0 executes generated configuration on a separate WSL Apache 2.4.58 instance; 78 checks pass and core TRACE handling now requires server/vhost TraceEnable Off. Owned server/output retired. Actual LiteSpeed, TLS/browser access, qualification and publication remain open; see C34 and MiniModel deploy/static-seed.md.
